            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td class="text-center fw-bold">TC-08</td>
                <td class="text-center">FR-04,<br>NFR-02</td>
                <td>Fitur 1:<br>Autentikasi Login</td>
                <td>Boundary Value Analysis<br>(Tepat Batas Maksimal)</td>
                <td>Login gagal tepat 3 kali berturut-turut - Tepat batas Lockout disertai hitung mundur (Boundary Value Test: Batas Maksimal)</td>
